{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1000_p", "source_sha256": "01945bebef327e437d2a721aae390ca6526f4a655c42df59f2e8516618bcdc6c", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希。\n熱心にスマホを見てどうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n你这么专心地看手机，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "3b61da18489e9fedd0a2ae754db91d9b992dd350ee28c20026b480f7cdd4e82d", "ja": "お疲れさまです。{$P$}も見ますか？\n先日、海へ潜った時の動画です。", "zh": "辛苦了。{$P$}也要看看吗？\n这是前几天潜水时拍的视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7701d2c7b6ff0a2eb48b7329eb5244c581fa8238e9ce663ad619bdaed4ee130e", "ja": "ああ、ダイビングの。たしかイルカと間違えて、\nサメと一緒に泳いだんだよな。", "zh": "啊，是潜水的那个。记得你当时把鲨鱼误认成海豚，还和它一起游泳来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1f148bf68bd208a5d52078149ac79033aef94260790176c87a133298964702b", "ja": "はい。あれから何度も見返しています。\n毎日見ても飽きないかわいさです。……ほっこり。", "zh": "是的。从那以后我看了好多遍。\n每天看也不会腻的可爱……让人心里暖暖的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0471cf76133b753d09a852d15170094ab5778bf4d57328e67cc4b48973894269", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n普通サメと聞いたら怖がりそうだけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。一般听到鲨鱼都会害怕吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "baf35b624697000706d8dd3080d61f8a4a0dc5d8be4de4732b91a24b444ed375", "ja": "最初に出会ったのがあの子だったからかもしれません。\nとても優しいサメでしたから。", "zh": "也许是因为我最初遇到的就是那孩子吧。\n那是一条非常温柔的鲨鱼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "1359525fe2086f912dd322056d57bc77e5ec188fc2c60dbfc515894c6c55a3e6", "ja": "おかげで、サメのかわいさを知ることができました。\n……大感謝だぞ。", "zh": "多亏了它，我才知道鲨鱼有多可爱。\n……真是太感谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5ddff2d8f59a28ee27c7a54b53e55b5587174543da261d20493875b38411e6df", "ja": "そうだな。そんなに気に入ったなら……。また\nサメ関係の仕事がある時は、瑞希にお願いしようかな？", "zh": "是啊。既然你这么喜欢……下次再有和鲨鱼有关的工作，就拜托瑞希了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0542_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "3b13a9729a2eeb2c44daaa5f6dc857b9144d2412b0a5655deb27505a6707fed5", "ja": "なんと……本当ですか？　その時はぜひ。みなさんに\nサメの可愛さを届けてみせます。……わくわく。", "zh": "真的吗……？到时候请务必让我来。我要把鲨鱼的可爱之处传达给大家。……好期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
